[{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1339","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1339.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1118","title":"Sun Solaris ndd 本地拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Solaris 2.6 系统中的 ndd 工具存在安全配置缺陷，本地攻击者可通过修改特定 TCP/IP 协议栈参数（如 TCP 窗口大小、重传超时等），导致系统网络协议栈行为异常，进而引发拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Solaris 2.6 版本，攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限，无需高权限即可触发。由于 ndd 工具未对参数修改操作进行充分的权限校验和范围限制，导致低权限用户可滥用该工具破坏网络功能。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1118"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1998-03-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:45Z","remediation":"升级到受支持的 Solaris 版本（如 Solaris 11）或迁移至其他受支持操作系统。如无法升级，通过 chmod 700 /usr/sbin/ndd 限制 ndd 命令仅允许 root 执行，并通过 RBAC 策略细化网络参数修改权限，同时启用审计日志监控 ndd 调用行为。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["http://sunsolve.sun.com/pub-cgi/retrieve.pl?doctype=coll&doc=secbull/165&type=0&nav=sec.sba","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/433","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/817","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a662dc905cd549a2105daacbfce64cf01652761d/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1118.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1118","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/5cf8ba64f356efe9269b21eca2f657231acd746c/content/CVE-1999-1118.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/263f37bc67cd24fe03a39077d8b57f3001369a95/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1118.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/bf2339193e1c10dc2db330718adeb8cc8d88c4dd/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-65xg-v5wp-9qwj/GHSA-65xg-v5wp-9qwj.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/134977c5f4ce4f427a914ca161b4f075e34b560b/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1118.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154000_154100.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--ba73844d-26ab-45be-a3a4-932204272907.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/26d249099e240aac89bdddbef7937b266937e448/1999.tsv","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1339.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1499","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1499.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1407","title":"RedHat DHCP ifdhcpc-done 脚本符号链接漏洞","description":"RedHat Linux 5 系统中的 DHCP 客户端脚本 ifdhcpc-done 存在符号链接漏洞。当 DHCP 客户端获取到 IP 地址时，该脚本会以不安全的方式向 /tmp/dhcplog 文件追加日志，攻击者可通过预先创建指向任意系统文件（如 /etc/passwd）的符号链接，导致日志内容被追加到目标文件中，进而实现本地权限提升或破坏系统文件完整性。该漏洞需攻击者拥有本地用户权限，且 DHCP 客户端被触发时方可利用。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1407"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1998-03-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:22Z","remediation":"建议升级 Red Hat Linux 至 6.0 及以上版本，该版本已修复 dhcp 客户端脚本中 dhcplog 文件路径可被符号链接预测的问题。如无法升级，可修改 /etc/sysconfig/network-scripts/ifdhcpc-done 脚本，将日志写入使用 mktemp 创建的临时文件而非固定路径 /tmp/dhcplog，并确保脚本以非 root 权限运行以限制文件写入范围。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=88950856416985&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7294.php","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/rh50-errata-general.html#initscripts","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/368","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/36911ad057245f7d02822794db0f459d9b4c9b8f/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1407.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1407","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1407.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3012e5f1cf9bcfe839897275a956236aed334269/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1407.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fc4ea30e7f21aebcdcc3fac6ec198138ebd3f7f5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-2rcm-7f2m-m5qc/GHSA-2rcm-7f2m-m5qc.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1407.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154000_154100.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000268.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--49a242eb-7471-4cd4-ad29-c7c1b544e693.json","https://github.com/Christopher0129/security-knowledge-base/blob/ecec748afe5bbe2fcd2fd04b00fb46bc827b2c5d/system-vulnerabilities/linux.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1499.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1441","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1441.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1272","title":"SGI IRIX cdrom 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"IRIX 操作系统 CDROM 可靠性检测程序（cdrom）存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。由于程序在处理 CDROM 设备检测数据时未对输入长度进行充分校验，本地攻击者可通过向该程序提交特制的超长输入数据触发栈缓冲区溢出，从而覆盖函数返回地址或关键数据结构。成功利用该漏洞可导致权限提升，攻击者将获得 root 权限，进而完全控制目标系统。该漏洞影响 IRIX 多个版本，攻击者需具备本地系统访问权限方可利用此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1272"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1998-03-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:05Z","remediation":"立即安装 SGI 安全公告 19980301-01-PX 中提供的补丁程序，该补丁修复了 cdrom 程序中的缓冲区溢出漏洞。由于 SGI IRIX 已停止维护，建议将系统迁移至受支持的操作系统（如 Linux）以彻底消除风险。如无法立即迁移，可通过限制本地用户对 cdrom 程序的执行权限（chmod 750 /usr/sbin/cdrom）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/1635","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/30c3a896d257362f7419b0c772be2f3dd063ccaa/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1272.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1272","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1272.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9b79b5eac5a874eeb91f0d9e37084feed8b830f5/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1272.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/cdfc8886d71af7ef3bdab3e4db46753ff8af6538/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-cqf3-4mqj-g93x/GHSA-cqf3-4mqj-g93x.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x84000/83033/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1272.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--d88e047e-f36f-49bf-a27a-92bac54de998.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_gainpre.txt","https://github.com/Ethishh/securin_assessment/blob/e6ce9197b6593ae46f3f5646d268181eea6cbb31/cve_sync.log"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1441.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0752","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0752.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0502","title":"Unix SSH 默认空口令远程登录漏洞","description":"Unix 系统存在默认账户或空密码配置漏洞，当管理员未设置密码或密码为空时，攻击者可通过 SSH 服务使用常见默认用户名（如 root、admin）进行远程登录尝试。成功登录后可获系统完全控制权限，执行任意命令。该漏洞影响大量未正确配置账户安全的 Unix/Linux 系统，利用难度低、危害严重。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0502"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1998-03-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:31Z","remediation":"立即检查所有本地 Unix 系统账户，为每个账户设置强密码（至少 12 位，含大小写字母、数字及特殊字符）；删除或禁用无密码账户及默认测试账户；配置 `/etc/shadow` 确保密码哈希字段非空；启用 PAM 模块 `pam_pwquality.so` 强制密码复杂度策略，并在 SSH 配置中设置 `PermitEmptyPasswords no` 禁止空密码登录。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0502","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/41694","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/6e5939e8074723d33adaf5b2f8b0352edab9ba8d/1999/CVE-1999-0502.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/122439703ba8729c2a612b649ea87112305b8e28/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0502.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0502","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/1999/CVE-1999-0502.rules","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/968abdc74763b43a3cdd216fbb1950cab484f982/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bc69cd1e5221f68ef56bd10c5c61adf76a19f0fc/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0502.json","https://github.com/vulncheck-oss/0day.today.archive/blob/3664abdd71985a44aff3260896a8f36e2f4a9682/remote-exploits/20781.txt","https://github.com/gottburgm/Exploits/blob/fd340a05cbec416e89bfae898e27bf5fcb429101/MSFExploits/DELL/MSF/Idrac_infos.txt","https://github.com/DefectDojo/django-DefectDojo/blob/d9905eb7656178d3e59e0bf8f1d53a9ee9e50186/unittests/scans/openvas/many_vuln.xml","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/account_lp.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0752.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0545","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0545.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0330","title":"Linux bdash 游戏缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Linux bdash 游戏程序存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地攻击者可通过向游戏程序提交特制的输入数据触发缓冲区溢出，成功利用后可获取 root 权限，实现本地权限提升。该漏洞影响运行 bdash 游戏的 Linux 系统，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。攻击前提是攻击者拥有系统的本地账户访问权限。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0330"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1998-03-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:10Z","remediation":"立即移除 bdash 游戏的 setuid root 权限位（执行 chmod u-s /usr/games/bdash），或直接卸载 bsdgames 软件包以彻底消除提权风险。如确需保留该游戏，应升级至已修复缓冲区边界检查的修补版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["https://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=87602558319119&w=2"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0545.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0532","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0532.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0320","title":"Sun SunOS rpc.cmsd 任意文件覆盖提权漏洞","description":"SunOS/Solaris 系统的 rpc.cmsd（日历管理服务守护进程）存在任意文件覆写漏洞。rpc.cmsd 以 root 权限运行，由于对用户提交的 RPC 参数缺乏充分的路径验证，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标系统的日历管理服务发送特制 RPC 请求，覆写任意系统文件，从而获取 root 访问权限。该漏洞影响 SunOS 5.3 至 5.5.1（Solaris 2.3 至 2.5.1）版本，CVSS 评分 9.3，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0320"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1998-03-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:08Z","remediation":"针对 SunOS/Solaris 2.x 系统，安装 Sun Security Bulletin #166 提供的对应版本补丁：Solaris 2.3 安装 101318 补丁、Solaris 2.4 安装 101945 补丁、Solaris 2.5 安装 103093 补丁、Solaris 2.5.1 安装 103094 补丁。如业务不需要日历管理服务，可停止 rpc.cmsd 守护进程（/etc/init.d/calendar stop）并注释 rpc 绑定条目作为临时缓解。对于仍在运行的遗留系统，建议迁移至 Oracle Solaris 11 及以上受支持版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["http://sunsolve.sun.com/pub-cgi/retrieve.pl?doctype=coll&doc=secbull/166"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0532.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0451","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0451.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0266","title":"Info2www CGI 输入处理远程命令执行漏洞","description":"Info2www 是一个用于将 GNU Info 文档转换为 HTML 格式的 CGI 脚本程序。该脚本对用户输入的参数缺乏充分的过滤与验证，远程攻击者可通过向 info2www CGI 脚本发送特制请求，利用输入处理缺陷实现任意文件读取或远程命令执行。该漏洞影响 Info2www 1.0 及 1.1 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高危。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0266"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"1998-03-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:02Z","remediation":"立即从 Web 服务器移除 info2www CGI 脚本目录（通常位于 /cgi-bin/info2www），或删除 info2www 文件。如仍需此类功能，改用维护中的替代方案（如 Pinfo）。通过 Web 服务器配置限制 CGI 目录执行权限，确保仅授权用户可执行，并在 WAF 层过滤包含特殊字符（如 |、;、`、$()）的 CGI 请求参数。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1995","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20430","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/8600ac0c091970175de0b53d9682f50858aef8dc/1999/CVE-1999-0266.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0cda26301f5b3e56ace35e3d98835812d878db41/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0266.json","https://github.com/geeknik/the-nuclei-templates/blob/36a6d14bce3293907a83afb498caec5fd45b1777/CVE-1999-0266.yaml","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0266","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/36c16d53eb6071e39cfc3cf88e99f1b340ec913b/data/year/1999.txt","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/ac9605f5a915670fd80cb4e1904f4435f1835b65/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-1999-0266.yaml","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0266.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-0266.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/6eca843f42fd99fea8c9b630931afac7c9d4576c/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-5j6c-65fm-f6cr/GHSA-5j6c-65fm-f6cr.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/snort/drop-rules/web-cgi.rules"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0451.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1150","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1150.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0795","title":"Unix NIS+ rpc.nisd 服务身份认证绕过漏洞","description":"Unix NIS+ 命名服务中的 rpc.nisd 守护进程存在身份认证绕过漏洞，远程攻击者在无需任何身份凭证的情况下即可向服务器发起特定的 RPC 调用，从而获取系统敏感信息、禁用审计日志记录功能或篡改本地缓存数据。该漏洞影响运行 NIS+ 服务的 Unix 系统（如 Solaris），攻击者仅需具备网络可达性即可远程发起攻击，可导致信息泄露、审计失效及缓存被篡改，严重威胁系统安全性与完整性。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0795"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1998-03-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级到 SunOS 5.8 及更高版本（已包含 rpc.nisd 认证加固补丁）；若无法立即升级，应在 NIS+ 配置中启用强认证（nisauth.conf），禁用匿名 RPC 访问，并通过防火墙限制 32771/UDP（rpc.nisd）端口仅允许受信任网络访问，同时关闭不必要的 NIS+ 服务。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0795","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fe807f4098db5a5ad8dcb41a479197724cb9e789/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0795.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f61040ac78eb76aff0a3a68a8a8a4562940d3711/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-g8p5-fw36-3r3c/GHSA-g8p5-fw36-3r3c.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0795.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1150.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0768","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0768.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0514","title":"通用 UDP 广播数据包 Fraggle 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"CVE-1999-0514 是 Fraggle 拒绝服务攻击的漏洞，原理是目标系统允许接收发往广播地址的 UDP 消息，远程攻击者可通过伪造源 IP 向网络广播地址发送大量 UDP 数据包，触发网络内所有主机向目标发送响应流量，导致目标被流量淹没而拒绝服务。该漏洞影响大量配置不当的 UDP 服务，攻击条件低，危害较大。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0514"],"sources":["cve","epss"],"published":"1998-03-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"在路由器上配置 no ip directed-broadcast 禁止 UDP 定向广播转发，并在主机防火墙中丢弃发往广播地址的 UDP 请求包。对于 Unix 系统，禁用不必要的 UDP 服务并配置内核参数忽略广播流量。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0514","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/10323cb4135457b41074412d623aa2116c4e1200/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0514.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0514","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/45be3b4afd9c4397ee32a5cbf6819a590220b0c1/content/CVE-1999-0514.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4efc2590fd3e232024591793a186ed6577aaac2a/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0514.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/cdec8f567bb266b7b6813bda45223a258023f538/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-jgmj-x9w7-75p7/GHSA-jgmj-x9w7-75p7.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0514.json","https://github.com/nbrito/source/blob/7cf72f44a54cbe709dbbac0935c73bf4ba0649d0/c/t50/README.md","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000266.txt","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt","https://github.com/Ananyacodes/portfolio/blob/0a9200a34a11981e767d3c8b2e890392dbe4c1a0/scanner_backend.py"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0768.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1416","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1416.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1229","title":"id Software Quake 2 Server 符号链接任意文件读取漏洞","description":"Quake 2 Server 3.13 for Linux 在加载 config.cfg 配置文件时未对文件权限进行充分校验，本地攻击者可通过建立符号链接将 config.cfg 指向任意目标文件，从而以服务器进程权限读取系统敏感文件。该漏洞影响 Quake 2 Server 3.13 版本，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限才能利用。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1229"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1998-02-25T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:59Z","remediation":"升级至 Quake 2 server 3.14 或更高版本，该版本已修复对 config.cfg 配置文件的符号链接检查缺陷。若无法升级，确保 config.cfg 文件仅属主可写（chmod 644），禁止将服务器运行目录置于其他用户可写的路径下，并启用文件系统防符号链接攻击保护（如将受保护目录挂载为 nosuid、nosymfollow）。也可切换到开源的 Yamagi Quake II 等现代移植版，其已彻底修复此问题。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/8590","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/733","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7481e97cf7b60a5b982d99d7dad1ea61174940fb/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1229.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1229","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/1fe9b156eeeb72b8f8baa50bbe7bc0d9806e8c64/content/CVE-1999-1229.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c1321b1a6b0cb3a4c18f791e2c8443742c0cb0b0/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1229.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/cdfc8886d71af7ef3bdab3e4db46753ff8af6538/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-xq49-p575-q243/GHSA-xq49-p575-q243.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x88000/87553/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/63d4031680b3d3fa77b826660a1e30ffc70ff5cd/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1229.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/1999.tsv","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154000_154100.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000264.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1416.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1540","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1540.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1486","title":"IBM AIX sadc 本地任意文件写入漏洞","description":"IBM AIX 4.1 至 4.3 版本中的性能数据收集工具 sadc 在通过 timex 等程序调用时存在符号链接攻击漏洞。由于 sadc 以 setgid adm 权限运行，本地攻击者可利用此缺陷创建恶意符号链接指向系统任意文件，从而覆盖目标文件内容，实现权限提升或破坏系统关键文件。该漏洞需本地访问权限，攻击复杂度低。","severity":"LOW","score":1.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1486"],"sources":["cve","avd"],"published":"1998-02-25T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级至 AIX 4.3.3 及以上版本（该版本已修复 sadc 的 setgid 竞争条件漏洞），或安装 IBM APAR IX87942。如无法升级，以 root 身份执行 `chmod 644 /usr/bin/sadc && chmod 644 /usr/bin/timex` 移除 setgid adm 权限位，阻断 symlink 覆盖任意文件的攻击路径。临时缓解措施可移除 /usr/bin/timex 的 sgid 位：`chmod g-s /usr/bin/timex`。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://techsupport.services.ibm.com/aix/fixes/v4/os/bos.acct.4.3.1.0.info","http://www-1.ibm.com/support/search.wss?rs=0&q=IX75554&apar=only","http://www-1.ibm.com/support/search.wss?rs=0&q=IX76330&apar=only","http://www-1.ibm.com/support/search.wss?rs=0&q=IX76853&apar=only","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/408","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7675","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-1999-1486"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1540.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0484","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0484.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0290","title":"Qbik WinGate Telnet Proxy 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Qbik WinGate Telnet 代理服务存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者通过向目标系统的 Telnet 代理端口发起大量本地主机连接请求，可耗尽代理服务资源导致服务崩溃，无法正常处理后续合法连接。该漏洞影响 Qbik WinGate 的 Telnet 代理模块，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程触发，风险等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0290"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1998-02-21T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:04Z","remediation":"建议升级 WinGate 至 4.0 及以上版本，该漏洞已在后续迭代中修复。如无法升级，可在 WinGate 网关属性中禁用 telnet 代理服务（取消 Telnet Proxy 复选框），或在防火墙上限制对 telnet 代理端口（默认 23）的入站连接数量，仅允许可信 IP 访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0290","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1421f0a4349d5d46275cadd9c7c62349edf9c8bb/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0290.js