需要具备目标系统的本地账户权限，通过编写恶意程序调用 mmap 对受保护文件进行写入操作，可导致篡改系统关键配置文件、日志文件或安全策略，破坏系统完整性。该漏洞影响多个 FreeBSD 版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0323"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1998-02-20T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:09Z","remediation":"建议升级至 NetBSD 1.4+ 或 FreeBSD 3.0+ 版本，其中已修复 mmap(2) 系统调用对不可变/仅追加文件的权限检查缺陷。对于 NetBSD 1.3/1.3.1，可应用的补丁（来自 ftp://ftp.NetBSD.ORG/pub/NetBSD/misc/security/patches/19980509-mmap）。如无法升级临时缓解措施，可将系统 securelevel 提升至 1 以上并避免在多进程间对设定了 append-only/immutable 标志的文件使用共享可写 mmap。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b8581edcbd9fb1606112c43470d0a7cb92a751f8/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0323.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0323","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/9074597bd191efd66c2a6bf1f5d8e60bc4801a90/content/CVE-1999-0323.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f6ced4f7862026f4207c9708deb4edf129c83fc5/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0323.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/057c97aa60eb958a2d272c7164e35c156db63b6c/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-r5jc-68gw-7fmq/GHSA-r5jc-68gw-7fmq.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x83000/82264/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0323.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--c2ea8a31-4149-4cb6-8c91-11842551ba1b.json","https://github.com/Ethishh/securin_assessment/blob/e6ce9197b6593ae46f3f5646d268181eea6cbb31/cve_sync.log","https://github.com/zephyros1603/RadiantProcessors/blob/7d44cb1cd4b9e088fbe463f1b19be50a04c2efe8/Backend/RAG/data/allitems.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0537.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1396","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1396.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1207","title":"NetXRay Web-Admin 工具缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"NetXRay 2.6 版本的 Web 管理工具中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送特制的超长 HTTP 请求触发该漏洞，导致目标服务崩溃引发拒绝服务，在特定条件下还可能执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 NetXRay 2.6 及早期版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高，建议用户尽快升级至不受影响版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1207"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1998-02-18T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:56Z","remediation":"NetXRay 2.6 产品已停止维护，无官方补丁可用。建议立即迁移至现代网络分析工具（如 Wireshark 或 Sniffer 替代品）。若无法迁移，应在防火墙层面限制对 web-admin 工具的访问，仅允许受信任管理 IP 连接，并启用主机防火墙阻止外部对 web-admin 端口的未经授权访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.efri.hr/~crv/security/bugs/NT/netxtray.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/907","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e8d44fc9434dcaf08511a3267e0bf049a6756de/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1207.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1207","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1207.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f9199c6ea2112c9d2536a126688b640a45f0982a/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1207.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f37077e857e7a28bab83d284c23299407fb1af7e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-8pr8-xhpc-5qqx/GHSA-8pr8-xhpc-5qqx.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88601/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1207.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154000_154100.json","https://github.com/o